  guideTitle: "How to Layer Rugs Without Tripping Over Them",
  metaTitle: "How to Layer Rugs",
  metaDescription: "Pair a flat base rug with a smaller top rug, size the border correctly, scale the patterns and keep the edges from tripping anyone, even on carpet.",
  heroImage: "/images/articles/layer-rugs-hero.webp",
